   SNOWFLAKE AI SQL FUNCTIONS - END-TO-END DEMO
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   Run each STEP top-to-bottom. 
   Role: ACCOUNTADMIN   Warehouse: COMPUTE_WH
   Objects: AI_DEMO_DB.DEMO  (dropped in STEP 10)
